## Backup

```sh
kubectl -n agenthub exec agenthub-postgresql-0 -- env PGPASSWORD="$(kubectl -n agenthub get secret agenthub-postgresql -o jsonpath='{.data.password}' | base64 -d)" pg_dump -U agenthub agenthub > agenthub.sql
```

